title: "agentic-code-reviewer"
abstract: "Production-grade agentic code reviewer: a multi-step LLM workflow with repository context retrieval, layered deterministic verification (regex, AST, symbol, taint), cross-category correlation, and reproducible benchmarking. Exposes the acr CLI and an interactive terminal UI."
